PASS  C3b 003FDFE0 cases kinds 0..4 (003FE20C-003FE27A), 01F2CC98 holds five row tables (then 00D23EE8, not a row table), 003FF360 allocates five rows (003FF656 -> 002CD4D0): kinds 0..4, selectors 0x40..0x44, high-band records {1,1} {2,3} {2,4} {2,4} {3,5}
